### Step 5: Executing Your Automation

Navigate to the root of your `ansible-virtualbox` directory in your terminal and use the following commands.

**To CREATE the VMs, configure SSH, and resize the disks:**

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts.yml site.yml --tags create
```

**To DELETE the VMs:**

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts.yml site.yml --tags delete```

**To run ONLY the disk resizing tasks on already existing VMs:**

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts.yml site.yml --tags resize
```
